<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Divine Sphere</h1>
<p>The spells of the divine sphere are prayers, granted by the powers the caster serves: healing and blessing for the good, curses and wounds for the evil, the holy and unholy words against the other side, aid and repulsion for the undead, and the finding of people and things. They draw on your divine power rather than your magic. Your ability in the sphere decides how well you cast them, and also how well you resist such spells cast on you (see <a cmd='#'>Help Spheres</a>).
</p><p>The spells, and who teaches them (guild level):
</p>
<pre>bless                  healer 9, paladin 35
unholy blessing        no guild teaches it
curse                  necromancer 18, dark knight 24
remove curse           healer 18, necromancer 24, paladin 24
cure light wounds      healer 0, paladin 10
cure serious wounds    healer 14, paladin 40
heal                   healer 30
dispel evil            healer 29, paladin 45
repel lesser undead    necromancer 2, dark knight 15, paladin 15
repel greater undead   necromancer 31
blind                  healer 8, necromancer 9
cure blind             healer 15, druid 29
locate object          healer 19, druid 35
locate person          healer 20, druid 37
aid                    healer 2
summer rain            healer 4, druid 7
find path              healer 18, druid 34
dispel good            necromancer 39, dark knight 45
raise dead             healer 27
resurrection           healer 40
find wanted            assassin 0
locate wanted          assassin 0
slow rot               necromancer 34
aid undead             necromancer 60
final rest             healer 70, paladin 80
polarity               druid 120
cause light wounds     healer 1, necromancer 1, dark knight 10
cause serious wounds   necromancer 12, healer 28, dark knight 40
harm                   necromancer 29, healer 37
deathly grasp          necromancer 60, healer 120
holy word              healer 80, paladin 90
holy touch             paladin 100
holy grasp             paladin 120
holy shout             paladin 160
unholy word            necromancer 40
unholy touch           dark knight 34, necromancer 80
unholy grasp           dark knight 50, necromancer 120
unholy shout           dark knight 120, necromancer 160
condemn                dark knight 35
</pre>
<p>Each spell has its own help: help and the spell's name.
</p><p><br />
